{"id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-definite-program.md","title":"Definite Program","display":"df-definite-program — Definite Program","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-definite-program","aliases":["57-df-definite-program"],"display":"df-definite-program — Definite Program","depends_on":["[[57-df-horn-clause]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-definite-program"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-definite-program</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definite-program — Definite Program"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Horn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Horn}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a> 的闭合正头子句，原子载体见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为候选子句集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span> 同时保留类成员和一元谓词调用。原定义没有有限性限制，此处不添加。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefProg}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Horn}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{DefProg}(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DefProg}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Horn}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{DefProg}(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条 Horn 子句已经是原定义要求的正原子头形式；展开成量化头与体的形式等价，但不能在存在量词里以定义号代替子句相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-horn-clause","status":"resolved","id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-horn-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-horn-clause","status":"resolved","id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Horn}$ 采用 [[57-df-horn-clause]] 的闭合正头子句，原子载体见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$P$ 为候选子句集；$\\mathrm{DefProg}$ 同时保留类成员和一元谓词调用。原定义没有有限性限制，此处不添加。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Horn}$ 采用 [[57-df-horn-clause]] 的闭合正头子句，原子载体见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$P$ 为候选子句集；$\\mathrm{DefProg}$ 同时保留类成员和一元谓词调用。原定义没有有限性限制，此处不添加。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Horn}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DefProg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DefProg}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Horn}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{DefProg}(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}.","display":true}],"bytes":884,"backlinks":[{"id":"336b1fe36586a678","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]；$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。$\\mathrm{CWA}(P)$ 保留原定义的正原子后承集合，既不改名，也不替换为带负文字的理论。另在 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$ 时，$A\\in B_S$、$\\mathfrak H_I(S)$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]、[[57-df-herbrand-structure]]；$\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}$ 为这个集合诱导的基原子真值结构。"},{"id":"931bc3d500f82dff","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]；子句矩阵 $A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n$ 见 [[57-df-horn-clause]]。限定这些矩阵原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；$I\\subseteq B_S$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]。$\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S$、原子代换和 $\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-ground-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。$\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})$ 是矩阵变量，不是闭合子句的空自由变量集。"},{"id":"f7fdeadb93806ad7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\sigma$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；$\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S$、$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-ground-substitution]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。本文件保持原本“没有成功的基实例反驳”的语义定义，不改为某一具体搜索策略的有限失败。"},{"id":"43bf0ac6633013d5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}$，$k\\geq1$，$1\\leq i\\leq k$；见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-horn-clause]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。作为状态的目标原子列随 $G$ 显式固定。"},{"id":"d2f6edd30be06d05","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]